---
source: crates/luck_linter/src/fixtures.rs
---
warning: unnecessary parentheses around `if` condition
 --> Luau:2:1
1 | local c = 1
2 | if (c) then elseif (c) then end
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
3 | while (c) do break end
help: Luau doesn't need parentheses around conditions
fix: remove unnecessary parentheses
  | local c = 1
  | if c then elseif (c) then end
  | while (c) do break end

warning: unnecessary parentheses around `elseif` condition
 --> Luau:2:13
1 | local c = 1
2 | if (c) then elseif (c) then end
  |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
3 | while (c) do break end
fix: remove unnecessary parentheses
  | local c = 1
  | if (c) then elseif c then end
  | while (c) do break end

warning: unnecessary parentheses around `while` condition
 --> Luau:3:1
2 | if (c) then elseif (c) then end
3 | while (c) do break end
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
fix: remove unnecessary parentheses
  | local c = 1
  | if (c) then elseif (c) then end
  | while c do break end

all fixes:
  | local c = 1
  | if c then elseif c then end
  | while c do break end

warning: unnecessary parentheses around `if` condition
 --> Luau:1:1
1 | if (f()) then end
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
2 | while ((c)) do break end
help: Luau doesn't need parentheses around conditions
fix: remove unnecessary parentheses
  | if f() then end
  | while ((c)) do break end

warning: unnecessary parentheses around `while` condition
 --> Luau:2:1
1 | if (f()) then end
2 | while ((c)) do break end
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
fix: remove unnecessary parentheses
  | if (f()) then end
  | while (c) do break end

all fixes:
  | if f() then end
  | while (c) do break end

