  | if c then elseif c then end
  | while(c)do break end

warning: unnecessary parentheses around `while` condition
 --> Luau:3:1
2 | if c then elseif(c)then end
3 | while(c)do break end
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
